#: src/main/java/com/atlauncher/data/MinecraftError.java:54
msgid "About Your Crash"
msgstr "崩溃内容"

#: src/main/java/com/atlauncher/data/MinecraftError.java:55
msgid ""
"Minecraft has crashed due to insufficent memory being "
"allocated.<br/><br/>Please go to the settings tab and increase the maximum "
"memory option and then try launching the instance again."
msgstr "Minecraft 因不够分配的内存而崩溃。<br/><br/> 请前往设置，增加最大内存选项，然后再试启动 Minecraft。"

#: src/main/java/com/atlauncher/data/MinecraftError.java:63
msgid ""
"Minecraft has crashed due to an incompatability with Forge and your version "
"of Java.<br/><br/>Please reinstall the instance to automatically fix the "
"problem, and then try launching the instance again."
msgstr ""
"Minecraft 由于 Forge 和您的 Java 版本不兼容而崩溃。<br/><br/> 请重新安装此整合包，以便修复问题，然后再试一次启动 "
"Minecraft。"

#: src/main/java/com/atlauncher/data/MinecraftError.java:71
msgid ""
"Minecraft has crashed due to not being compatible with your Java "
"version.<br/><br/>Most modded Minecraft is only compatible with Java 8, so "
"you must install Java 8 on your computer."
msgstr ""
"由于不兼容你的 Java 版本，Minecraft 已崩溃。<br/><br/>大部分修改过的 Minecraft 客户端只支持 Java 8 "
"，所以你必须在你的计算机上安装 Java 8。"

#: src/main/java/com/atlauncher/data/MinecraftError.java:74
msgid "Download Java 8"
msgstr "下载Java 8"

#: src/main/java/com/atlauncher/data/MinecraftError.java:83
msgid ""
"Minecraft has crashed due to not being compatible with your Java "
"version.<br/><br/>This version of Minecraft requires Java {0} or "
"newer.<br/><br/>Make sure you've selected the correct Java version in this "
"instances<br/>settings or not disabled the \"Use Java Provided By "
"Minecraft\" setting.<br/><br/>If it's still not working, you may be using a "
"mod that requires Java {0},<br/>but Minecraft only requires Java 8, so you "
"can go into the instances<br/>settings and in the \"Java\" tab, change the "
"\"Runtime Overide\"<br/>option to one that is Java {0} or newer."
msgstr ""
"Minecraft 因与您的Java版本不兼容而崩溃了。<br/><br/>该版本的 Minecraft 需要 Java {0} "
"或更新版本。<br/><br/>确保在此实例中设置中选择了正确的 Java 版本或勾选“使用 Minecraft 提供的 "
"Java”选项。<br/><br/>如果还是无法正常工作，你可能使用了需要 Java {0} 的模组，<br/>但是 Minecraft 自身仅需要 "
"Java 8 来运行。<br/>所以您需要在该实例的设置中取消选中“使用 Minecraft 提供的 Java”<br/>并手动提供 Java "
"{0}（或更新版本）的路径。"

