msgid "Server Is Vulnerable"
msgstr "服务器易受攻击"

#: src/main/java/com/atlauncher/data/Server.java:172
msgid ""
"This server is currently vulnerable to the Log4Shell exploit.<br/><br/>For "
"your safety, and of those on your server, please delete and recreate this "
"server.<br/><br/>Do you still want to launch the server (not recommended)?"
msgstr ""
"该服务器目前存在易被利用的 Log4Shell "
"漏洞。<br/><br/>为了您和服务器上所有玩家的安全，请删除并重新创建这个服务器。<br/><br/>仍要继续启动该服务器吗（不推荐）？"

#: src/main/java/com/atlauncher/data/Server.java:185
msgid "Cannot Launch Server"
msgstr "无法启动服务器"

#: src/main/java/com/atlauncher/data/Server.java:186
msgid ""
"We cannot launch this server for you. Please use \"Open Folder\" and run the"
" server manually.<br/><br/>If unsure how to do so, please contact the packs "
"support pages for more further help."
msgstr ""
"我们无法为你启动此服务器。请使用“打开文件夹”并手动运行服务器。<br/><br/>如果不确定如何操作，请联系整合包的支持页面获取更多帮助。"

#: src/main/java/com/atlauncher/data/Server.java:291
msgid "Failed To Launch Server"
msgstr "无法启动服务器"

#: src/main/java/com/atlauncher/data/Server.java:292
msgid ""
"The server couldn't be launched as we don't know how to launch "
"it.<br/><br/>Please open the server folder and run the {0} file manually."
msgstr "我们不知道如何启动该服务器。<br/><br/>请打开服务器文件夹并手动运行 {0} 。"

