msgstr "禁用自定义字体？"

#: src/main/java/com/atlauncher/gui/tabs/settings/GeneralSettingsTab.java:403
msgid ""
"This will disable custom fonts used by themes. If your system has issues "
"with font display not looking right, you can disable this to switch to a "
"default compatible font."
msgstr "这将禁用主题使用的自定义字体。如果你的系统有字体显示不正确的问题，你可以禁用这个功能，切换到默认的兼容字体。"

#: src/main/java/com/atlauncher/gui/tabs/settings/GeneralSettingsTab.java:425
msgid "Remember Window Size & Positions?"
msgstr "记住窗口大小和位置？"

#: src/main/java/com/atlauncher/gui/tabs/settings/GeneralSettingsTab.java:426
msgid ""
"This will remember the windows positions and size so they keep the same size"
" and position when you restart the launcher."
msgstr "将记住窗口的位置和大小，在重启启动器后保持大小和位置一致。"

#: src/main/java/com/atlauncher/gui/tabs/settings/GeneralSettingsTab.java:447
