msgid "Use Recycle Bin/Trash?"
msgstr "使用回收站/垃圾桶？"

#: src/main/java/com/atlauncher/gui/tabs/settings/GeneralSettingsTab.java:473
msgid ""
"This will use your operating systems recycle bin/trash where possible when "
"deleting files/instances/servers instead of just deleting them entirely, "
"allowing you to recover files if you make a mistake or want to get them "
"back."
msgstr "在删除文件/实例/服务器时，尽可能使用你操作系统的回收站/垃圾桶，而不是永久删除它们，如果你犯了错误或想找回它们，可以恢复文件。"

#: src/main/java/com/atlauncher/gui/tabs/settings/GeneralSettingsTab.java:493
msgid "Enable ARM Support?"
msgstr "启用 ARM 支持？"

#: src/main/java/com/atlauncher/gui/tabs/settings/GeneralSettingsTab.java:495
msgid ""
