msgid "Download Clearer"
msgstr "下载清理器"

#: src/main/java/com/atlauncher/gui/tabs/tools/DownloadClearerToolPanel.java:33
msgid ""
"This tool clears out all the downloads done by the launcher. This will not "
"affect any instances, but means new pack installs may take longer as it "
"needs to redownload mods."
msgstr "这个工具清除了启动器的所有下载。这不会影响任何实例，但意味着新的整合包安装可能需要更长的时间，因为它需要重新下载mods。"

#: src/main/java/com/atlauncher/gui/tabs/tools/DownloadClearerToolPanel.java:41
msgid "Success"
msgstr "成功"

#: src/main/java/com/atlauncher/gui/tabs/tools/DownloadClearerToolPanel.java:42
msgid "Successfully cleared the downloads."
msgstr "已成功清理下载文件。"

#: src/main/java/com/atlauncher/gui/tabs/tools/LibrariesDeleterToolPanel.java:31
msgid "Libraries Deleter"
msgstr "支持库删除器"

#: src/main/java/com/atlauncher/gui/tabs/tools/LibrariesDeleterToolPanel.java:33
msgid ""
"This tool clears out all the libraries used by Minecraft. Instances may need"
" to be reinstalled if launching them once doesn't download all libraries."
msgstr "这个工具会清理Minecraft用到的支持库。如果安装实例时没有下载所有的支持库，则可能需要重新安装实例。"

#: src/main/java/com/atlauncher/gui/tabs/tools/LibrariesDeleterToolPanel.java:42
msgid "Successfully deleted libraries."
msgstr "删除支持库成功。"

#: src/main/java/com/atlauncher/gui/tabs/tools/LogClearerToolPanel.java:31
msgid "Log Clearer"
msgstr "报告清除器"

#: src/main/java/com/atlauncher/gui/tabs/tools/LogClearerToolPanel.java:33
msgid ""
"This tool clears out all logs created by the launcher (not included those "
"made by instances) to free up space and old junk."
msgstr "此工具将清除加载器的记录(不包括模组包)以释放储存空间和垃圾。"

#: src/main/java/com/atlauncher/gui/tabs/tools/LogClearerToolPanel.java:42
msgid "Successfully cleared the logs."
msgstr "成功清除报告"

#: src/main/java/com/atlauncher/gui/tabs/tools/NetworkCheckerToolPanel.java:38
msgid "Network Checker"
msgstr "网络检查工具"

#: src/main/java/com/atlauncher/gui/tabs/tools/NetworkCheckerToolPanel.java:41
msgid ""
"This tool does various tests on your network and determines any issues that "
"may pop up with connecting to our file servers and to other servers."
msgstr "这个工具对您的网络进行各种测试，并可以确定任何链接到我们的服务器的问题。"

#: src/main/java/com/atlauncher/gui/tabs/tools/NetworkCheckerToolPanel.java:53
msgid ""
"Please note that the data from this tool is sent to ATLauncher so we can "
"diagnose possible issues in your setup. This test may take up to 10 minutes "
"or longer to complete and you will be unable to do anything while it's "
"running. Please also keep in mind that this test will use some of your "
"bandwidth, it will use approximately 100MB.<br/><br/>Do you wish to "
"continue?"
msgstr ""
"请记住这个工具所收集的信息会被发送到ATLauncher用来诊断可能的问题。此检查可能会用10分钟或更长的时间来完成并且运行时您无法执行任何其它操作。并且请注意此检查将会用到您的网络，大约会消耗100MB的数据。<br/><br/>确认继续吗？"

#: src/main/java/com/atlauncher/gui/tabs/tools/NetworkCheckerToolPanel.java:60
msgid "Network Checker Running. Please Wait!"
msgstr "网络检查工具正在运行。请稍等！"

#: src/main/java/com/atlauncher/gui/tabs/tools/NetworkCheckerToolPanel.java:78
msgid ""
"The network checker tool has completed and the data sent off to "
"ATLauncher.<br/><br/>Thanks for your input to help understand and fix "
"network related issues."
msgstr "网络检查工具已经完成，数据发送到ATLauncher。<br/><br/>感谢您的输入，这帮助了解和已修理网络相关的问题。"

